== proof: the constraints that carry the rules (REQ-05, REQ-11), the row-level security per table (REQ-10, REQ-16) and portal_app's sequence grants ==
           conname            |                                                                              pg_get_constraintdef                                                                              
------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 bank_needs_two               | CHECK (((type <> 'bank_details'::text) OR (status <> ALL (ARRAY['approved'::text, 'applied'::text])) OR (second_approver IS NOT NULL)))
 change_requests_status_check | CHECK ((status = ANY (ARRAY['submitted'::text, 'in_review'::text, 'awaiting_second_approval'::text, 'approved'::text, 'rejected'::text, 'cancelled'::text, 'applied'::text])))
 change_requests_type_check   | CHECK ((type = ANY (ARRAY['address'::text, 'bank_details'::text])))
 four_eyes                    | CHECK (((second_approver IS NULL) OR (second_approver <> first_approver)))
 rejection_has_reason         | CHECK (((status <> 'rejected'::text) OR (reason IS NOT NULL)))
